Aleph
God, ox, torus, yin yang, 1 (26, two gods 10 10 and a vav 6), a dot above a dot below and a diagonal line suspended between, the sound of opening your mouth to speak, as above, so below. God in heaven, man on earth, chief, teacher, wonderous, master of the universe, ultimate creator, breathe of life, a blessing, tarot the fool